    "identifier": "water-release-water-blending",
    "description": "<p>All willing creatures within range when this jutsu is cast and creatures that would begin their turns within range gain a +4 bonus to the Hide and Sneak skill actions until the end of your next turn as water bends the light around them hiding their presence. The jutsu ends on all affected creatures, if any of them attacks, casts a jutsu or physically interacts with another creature not under this jutsu’s effects.</p>",
